  "quickActionPrompt": "{id, select, watermelon{Hold a slice of watermelon with both hands, take a small bite, and smile contentedly.} durian{Pick up a small piece of durian, smell it, then taste a small bite.} lollipop{Raise a lollipop, gently lick it, and look playfully at the camera.} iceCream{Bring an ice cream to your mouth and taste a small bite with a relaxed, happy expression.} apple{Pick up an apple with one hand, take a small bite, and chew naturally.} burger{Hold a burger with both hands, take a small bite, and look happily at the camera.} fries{Pick up a fry, put it in your mouth, chew gently, and smile.} dumpling{Lift a dumpling with chopsticks, blow gently on it, and taste it.} crayfish{Pick up a crayfish and mime peeling the shell and tasting the meat.} cola{Pick up a can of cola, take a sip, and gently put it down.} seeds{Bring a sunflower seed to your mouth, mime cracking it gently, and put down the shell.} noodles{Lift a few instant noodles with chopsticks, blow gently on them, and taste them.} grapes{Pick a grape from a bunch, eat it, and smile.} milkTea{Hold a milk tea with both hands, sip through the straw, then look up and smile.} pigtails{Raise both hands, part your hair to the sides, and mime tying it into pigtails.} tuckHair{Raise one hand, gently tuck loose hair behind your ear, and smile softly.} highPonytail{Gather your hair with both hands and mime tying a high ponytail behind your head.} hairBun{Gather your hair with both hands and mime arranging it into a bun on top of your head.} hairFlip{Gently turn your head, let your hair sway naturally, then look at the camera.} bowClip{Pick up a bow hair clip, gently clip it to the side of your hair, and adjust it.} braid{Separate one side of your hair into strands, look down, and mime gently braiding it.} cap{Pick up a baseball cap, put it on backward, and gently adjust it.} twirlHair{Twirl a lock of hair beside your face around a finger, tilt your head slightly, and look natural.} sunglasses{Take out sunglasses, unfold and put them on, then lightly adjust the frame while looking at the camera.} lipstick{Pick up lipstick, gently apply it to your lips, then press your lips together.} heart{Make a heart with both hands in front of your chest, smile, and look at the camera.} microphone{Hold a microphone near your mouth and mime singing expressively with gentle movement.} winkPeace{Lean slightly toward the camera, wink, and make a peace sign beside your face.} readComments{Lean forward slightly and look attentively below the camera as if reading comments.} dance{Move your shoulders and upper body gently to a light rhythm, letting your hands dance naturally.} tiltSmile{Tilt your head gently to one side, look at the camera, and smile naturally.} hug{Open your arms toward the camera, lean forward slightly, and look eager for a hug.} salute{Raise one hand beside your forehead in a salute and smile playfully.} wave{Raise one hand with your palm toward the camera and wave gently from side to side in greeting.} pretendCry{Look exaggeratedly upset and gently wipe the corner of your eye as if pretending to cry.} nervous{Bring your fingers near your mouth as if biting your nails, frown slightly, and look nervous.} twoHandCheeks{Gently cup both cheeks, lean slightly toward the camera, and smile sweetly.} cuteSequence{In sequence, tilt your head, wink, smile with closed lips, cup your cheeks, shrug, make a heart, reach for a hug, and wave.} pipa{Hold a pipa in front of you, support its neck with your left hand, and gently pluck the strings with your right.} phoenixCrown{Lift a red phoenix crown with both hands, gently put it on your head, and straighten both sides.} shyPeace{Lean toward the camera, make a peace sign beside your face, lower your head slightly, and smile shyly.} floralCoat{Pick up a northeastern Chinese floral padded coat, mime putting it on, and straighten the front.} playfulFace{Face the camera, raise your eyebrows, wink, and wrinkle your nose in a playful face.} pokeCheek{Gently poke your cheek with an index finger, tilt your head, and look cute.} shyFingers{Hold your hands in front of your chest, gently touch your index fingertips together, and look down shyly.} touchEar{Lightly touch your earlobe, briefly look away, then look shyly at the camera.} thumbsUp{Raise one hand toward the camera, give a thumbs up, and smile in approval.} thankYou{Press your palms together in front of your chest, nod gently, and look sincerely grateful.} relief{Gently wipe your forehead with the back of your hand, relax your shoulders, and look relieved.} massageShoulder{Gently massage the opposite shoulder and neck with one hand, tilt your head, and relax.} surrender{Raise both hands beside your shoulders, palms forward, with an innocent, playful expression.} drawHeart{Extend your index finger, slowly trace a heart in front of the camera, then smile and lower your hand.} pokeScreen{Bring your index finger toward the camera as if gently tapping the screen, and smile playfully.} adjustCollar{Look down at your collar, smooth and straighten it with both hands, then look up.} realization{Lightly pat your forehead, raise your eyebrows, and look as if you suddenly understand.} think{Rest an index finger beside your chin, glance slightly upward, and look thoughtful.} quiet{Hold an index finger upright in front of your lips, press your lips together gently, and signal quiet.} helpless{Spread your hands to either side, shrug lightly, and look helpless.} leanBack{Slowly lean back against the chair, relax your shoulders, and look at ease.} countFingers{Raise one hand in front of your chest and extend your fingers in order to count from one to five.} turnAround{If the frame has enough room, slowly turn around once and return to facing the camera.} stretch{Stretch both arms upward and gently extend your upper body, then lower your arms naturally.} cheer{Hold loose fists in front of your chest, move them gently up and down, and smile encouragingly.} clap{Clap gently a few times in front of your chest, smile, and nod in happy approval.} follow{Face the camera, point an index finger toward the bottom of the frame, and gesture to invite a follow.} supportSign{Raise a small support sign with both hands, show it to the camera, and smile encouragingly.} snap{Raise one hand beside your shoulder and mime snapping your thumb and middle finger once.} blowKiss{Touch your fingers lightly to your lips, then extend your hand toward the camera to blow a kiss.} wink{Lean slightly toward the camera, wink one eye, and smile.} giggle{Lightly cover your mouth, smile with your eyes, and let your shoulders move gently as you giggle.} tongue{Look at the camera, briefly stick out the tip of your tongue, then withdraw it with a playful expression.} pretendAngry{Put your hands on your hips, lean toward the camera, then point lightly toward it while pretending to be angry.} fingerGun{Make a finger gun with your thumb and index finger, point it lightly toward the camera, then smile and lower your hand.} kissCamera{Slowly lean toward the camera, gently purse your lips in a kiss, then move back naturally.} pinkyPromise{Extend your little finger toward the camera and move it gently as if inviting a pinky promise.} daydream{Rest your cheek on one hand, let your gaze drift, and look quiet and relaxed.} sleepy{Lower your head slightly, gently rub the corner of your eye with the back of your hand, then look up sleepily.} funnyFace{Gently pull down one lower eyelid with a finger and briefly stick out your tongue in a playful face.} handFrame{Make a frame with both thumbs and index fingers in front of your face, and look through it at the camera.} devilHorns{Raise both hands beside the top of your head and extend both index fingers to imitate little devil horns.} overheadCircle{Curve both arms above your head into a large circle and smile at the camera.} airplane{Extend both arms to the sides like airplane wings and tilt your body gently.} claspFists{Clasp your hands in front of your chest, brighten your eyes, and look happily expectant.} elegant{Lift one hand near your mouth, rest the other at your waist, and raise your head slightly with elegant playfulness.} oneHip{Rest one hand at your waist, let the other hang naturally, and turn slightly to one side.} bothHips{Rest both hands at your waist with elbows naturally outward, and look up at the camera.} shadeEyes{Hold one hand horizontally above your eyes as if shading them from sunlight, and look forward.} palmsUp{Spread both hands to the sides in front of your chest, palms up, with a relaxed expression.} foldHands{Fold your hands naturally in front of your knees, sit upright, and look calm.} handOnHeart{Place one hand gently on your chest, look at the camera, and appear sincere and gentle.} oneHandCheek{Support one cheek lightly with one hand and tilt your head slightly toward your palm.} chinRest{Rest your chin lightly on one hand and look thoughtfully toward the camera.} lookDown{Slowly lower your head, look down naturally, and pause briefly.} leanForward{Lean your upper body gently toward the camera and look as if listening attentively.} flex{Bend one arm with a loose fist, raise your upper arm, and pose as if showing your muscles.} doraemon{Lift a Doraemon plush to your chest with both hands, show it to the camera, then hug it gently.} ultraman{Pick up an Ultraman toy, show it in front of you to the camera, and move it gently.} pikachu{Hold a Pikachu plush beside your face with both hands and smile while showing it to the camera.} flowers{Take a bouquet from beside you, hold it in front of your chest with both hands, and gently offer it toward the camera.} cake{Hold a small cake with both hands at chest height and smile while showing it.} selfie{Take out a phone with its screen facing you, raise your arm slightly, and pose for a selfie.} cat{Gently hold a kitten in front of your chest, support its body with one hand, and stroke its back with the other.} dog{Gently hold a puppy in front of you, smile at the camera, and pet it softly.} smile{Look at me and smile naturally.} nod{Nod gently with a smile.} peace{Make a peace sign beside your face and smile at the camera.} other{}}",
